01:30.987 --> 01:35.997
I'm Always Watching

02:04.907 --> 02:06.407
What the hell...

02:06.497 --> 02:08.827
Minato Sensei tells us to assemble
and he's the one who's late!

02:09.207 --> 02:10.657
Give me a break...

02:10.867 --> 02:12.327
You're one to talk!

02:12.457 --> 02:13.157
What did you say?

02:13.327 --> 02:13.867
Eh?

02:14.247 --> 02:15.907
Come on, you two...

02:15.997 --> 02:17.207
Want to do this?

02:18.037 --> 02:20.537
Hey! Did you just scoff at me?

02:20.907 --> 02:21.907
What of it?

02:21.907 --> 02:22.867
Sorry to keep you waiting.

02:23.157 --> 02:24.577
You're all here, I see.

02:28.997 --> 02:31.537
Minato Sensei!
Do we have a new mission?!

02:31.827 --> 02:32.997
Not today.

02:37.907 --> 02:38.957
What is that?

02:39.577 --> 02:40.537
They're applications.

02:41.577 --> 02:43.957
I recommended you three
for promotion to Chunin.

02:52.997 --> 02:55.457
Minato Sensei... You're awesome!

02:55.657 --> 02:56.537
Hey...

02:57.157 --> 02:58.117
Don't jump the gun.

02:58.367 --> 02:59.037
Huh?

02:59.287 --> 03:01.537
You have to take
the Chunin Exam first.

03:02.707 --> 03:03.657
What...

03:04.537 --> 03:07.827
There are three parts
to the exam

03:07.957 --> 03:09.907
and each one is quite difficult.

03:10.247 --> 03:12.957
Oh... Are you kidding me?

03:14.457 --> 03:16.497
You'll never pass since
you can't even make it

03:16.577 --> 03:17.997
to a rendezvous on time.

03:18.077 --> 03:19.157
What did you say?!

03:19.247 --> 03:20.827
Hey, you two!

03:21.247 --> 03:22.207
Anyway...

03:22.827 --> 03:24.327
You've worked together

03:24.407 --> 03:27.537
and earned the right to take
the Chunin Exam.

03:27.617 --> 03:28.787
That's why I recommended you.

03:29.457 --> 03:32.657
However, it's not compulsory.

03:33.287 --> 03:36.037
Whether you take the exam
or not is entirely up to you.

03:39.827 --> 03:40.827
I wouldn't miss it...!

03:46.707 --> 03:48.407
<b>CHUNIN EXAM
PART ONE</b>

03:49.907 --> 03:51.157
<i>Aw man!</i>

03:51.957 --> 03:53.247
<i>This is a Chunin Exam,</i>

03:53.327 --> 03:55.657
<i>so I was expecting stuff like</i>
<i>ninjutsu and taijutsu...</i>

03:55.867 --> 04:00.077
<i>But this is a written test...</i>
<i>the kind I'm weakest in!</i>

04:08.827 --> 04:09.867
Finished already?

04:10.247 --> 04:10.997
Yes.

04:16.907 --> 04:19.827
<i>Th-That Kakashi...!</i>

04:22.247 --> 04:25.117
<i>Aw man, I'm done for...</i>

04:29.707 --> 04:30.037
Huh?!

04:42.497 --> 04:43.827
<b>I'M ALWAYS WATCHING YOU
-RIN</b>

04:52.207 --> 04:52.957
<i>Rin...</i>

05:17.907 --> 05:19.657
<b>RIN NOHARA</b>

05:19.747 --> 05:20.537
There it is!

05:20.617 --> 05:21.657
I did it!

05:27.537 --> 05:29.157
<b>KAKASHI HATAKE</b>

05:29.907 --> 05:30.327
Well...

05:31.907 --> 05:32.957
What did you expect?

05:36.287 --> 05:38.207
That was just a written test!

05:38.997 --> 05:41.957
Just wait and see!
I'll find my name!

06:00.707 --> 06:01.907
<b>END OF LIST</b>

06:03.457 --> 06:04.707
I guess not...

06:05.707 --> 06:06.327
Obito!

06:06.657 --> 06:07.827
Look! There!

06:10.957 --> 06:14.867
<b>THE FOLLOWING HAS BEEN
ACCEPTED DUE TO A VACANCY
OBITO UCHIHA</b>

06:19.827 --> 06:21.577
I did it!

06:21.657 --> 06:24.157
A vacancy, huh...
That's so like you.

06:24.367 --> 06:25.287
What?!

06:25.457 --> 06:27.367
Come on, you two.

06:27.657 --> 06:29.617
You don't have time
to celebrate!

06:31.617 --> 06:33.867
If you passed,
go to your assigned classroom!

06:34.327 --> 06:36.537
We'll explain the second part
of the exam.

06:39.577 --> 06:41.037
Part Two will commence
three days from now.

06:41.707 --> 06:43.617
This will test your physical skills.

06:44.407 --> 06:48.157
Use everything you learned
about taijutsu and ninjutsu...

06:48.997 --> 06:50.827
to get through this exam!

06:50.997 --> 06:52.787
All right! I got this!

06:52.867 --> 06:56.827
However, this test pits
your team against others.

06:57.117 --> 06:59.827
Huh? It's not
an individual competition?!

07:00.537 --> 07:03.617
Kakashi! You'd better not
drag us down!

07:05.907 --> 07:08.207
Right back at you.

07:08.287 --> 07:08.827
What?!

07:10.867 --> 07:13.077
Will you two stop it?!

07:21.957 --> 07:24.867
Especially... don't be late.

07:25.957 --> 07:26.657
I know!

07:27.747 --> 07:30.457
<b>CHUNIN EXAM PART TWO
TEAM COMPETITION</b>

07:49.407 --> 07:52.207
Kakashi Hatake is also
participating in the test, right?

07:52.287 --> 07:54.497
Yes, he's on the next team.

07:54.827 --> 07:57.157
Ah, I'm looking forward to this.

08:16.957 --> 08:19.787
<b>KAKASHI OBITO RIN
GUY EBISU GENMA
IBIKI HAYATE TOKARA</b>

08:22.577 --> 08:25.367
Team Minato,
you have five minutes left.

08:25.457 --> 08:26.617
Will he make it?!

08:26.827 --> 08:29.827
Yes! I'm sure he'll be here
in a minute.

08:30.997 --> 08:35.037
If time runs out,
you'll be automatically disqualified.

08:36.117 --> 08:38.747
I knew it! Didn't I tell you?!

08:40.707 --> 08:42.327
You're too easy on him, Rin.

08:42.407 --> 08:44.457
That's why he'll never break
this habit of being late!

08:45.077 --> 08:46.407
He'll be here.

08:46.657 --> 08:50.287
Something must've happened
to delay him.

08:50.957 --> 08:52.957
He'll make it in time.

08:54.707 --> 08:55.907
I wouldn't be so sure.

09:00.457 --> 09:04.997
<b>HIDDEN LEAF HOSPITAL</b>

09:05.747 --> 09:07.827
Here, have some candy.

09:11.407 --> 09:12.707
3:00 pm.

09:13.827 --> 09:14.957
It's time to begin.

09:15.207 --> 09:17.207
Damn it, all because of him!

09:19.037 --> 09:19.957
I know he'll...

09:21.157 --> 09:22.707
I'm sorry I'm late!

09:28.157 --> 09:31.327
See! I told you Obito would make it,
no matter what!

09:31.907 --> 09:33.497
Hurry, before we're disqualified!

09:37.827 --> 09:38.997
Oh, boy!

09:39.907 --> 09:42.787
We will now begin part two,
the team competition...

09:42.867 --> 09:44.157
Preliminary qualifier!

09:45.537 --> 09:46.077
Begin!

09:49.907 --> 09:51.787
<i>Fire Style! Fireball—</i>

10:23.537 --> 10:25.867
<b>CHUNIN EXAM PART THREE
INDIVIDUAL COMPETITION</b>

10:29.497 --> 10:32.747
I'm going to have you pay me back
in full for the last time.

10:33.867 --> 10:34.957
The "last time"?

10:35.367 --> 10:36.207
What?!

10:36.287 --> 10:38.077
Don't tell me
you don't remember?!

10:38.247 --> 10:38.997
Who are you?

10:39.827 --> 10:41.657
What did I do to earn
your wrath?!

10:41.747 --> 10:42.657
Why you—!

10:42.747 --> 10:43.997
Don't take me for a fool!

10:44.997 --> 10:47.157
Do your best, Obito!

10:51.907 --> 10:53.867
All right... Just watch me!

10:54.537 --> 10:55.207
Begin!

10:55.827 --> 10:56.497
Huh?!

11:00.787 --> 11:02.497
The winner is Might Guy!

11:03.457 --> 11:05.157
What is he doing?

11:18.367 --> 11:19.617
Do your best!

11:21.707 --> 11:22.577
Go...!

11:23.367 --> 11:24.077
Kakashi!

11:36.907 --> 11:37.827
Stop!

11:38.207 --> 11:40.327
The winner is Kakashi Hatake!

11:41.247 --> 11:42.327
He did it!

11:50.407 --> 11:53.037
You passed the Chunin Exam
on your first try.

11:53.407 --> 11:56.407
Kakashi, you're amazing!
Isn't he, Obito?

11:58.117 --> 11:58.957
Humph.

12:00.997 --> 12:01.617
Obito...

12:24.037 --> 12:25.657
So this is where you were.

12:29.867 --> 12:31.907
O-Oh, it's you, Rin.

12:35.497 --> 12:37.537
It's only natural
that Kakashi passed.

12:38.537 --> 12:40.497
But we can too, I know it!

12:41.997 --> 12:43.867
Let's practice hard
for next year!

12:44.497 --> 12:48.407
But it's hard to get motivated
after watching Kakashi...

12:48.907 --> 12:50.077
What are you saying?!

12:56.207 --> 12:57.577
You're going to be Hokage, right?

12:59.867 --> 13:02.077
I'm always watching you!

13:05.367 --> 13:06.117
Yeah!

13:38.637 --> 13:39.517
Obito?

13:43.857 --> 13:45.067
I did it!

13:45.147 --> 13:46.767
I'm a Chunin now!

13:47.187 --> 13:48.147
Congratulations!

13:55.687 --> 13:58.267
Meet me later at the park
under the cherry tree.

14:03.397 --> 14:04.727
<i>Today for sure...</i>

14:04.817 --> 14:07.227
<i>I'm going to tell Rin</i>
<i>how I feel about her!</i>

14:10.267 --> 14:11.647
Sorry I'm late...

14:12.477 --> 14:13.817
– No...
– Everyone!

14:14.437 --> 14:15.187
Everyone?

14:16.857 --> 14:19.017
Why? Uh, Why...

14:19.817 --> 14:21.227
Why is everyone here?!

14:22.227 --> 14:25.567
I asked them to come
to discuss the gift.

14:26.107 --> 14:28.647
Huh? What gift?!

14:29.107 --> 14:32.727
Well, Kakashi is being promoted
to Jonin.

14:33.067 --> 14:36.317
So, we're going to...
give him a present.

14:36.397 --> 14:39.107
<b>CLASS PROJECT
GIFT FOR KAKASHI'S PROMOTION
TO JONIN
(TOP SECRET MISSION)</b>

14:39.397 --> 14:40.897
Kakashi's a Jonin?

14:41.107 --> 14:43.267
Oh? Didn't you know, Obito?

14:44.477 --> 14:47.687
It's something to be proud of
as his classmates.

14:49.357 --> 14:50.187
Yeah...

14:55.977 --> 14:59.517
What do you think
Kakashi would like?

14:59.857 --> 15:02.067
Well... Since we're talking about him,

15:02.567 --> 15:03.937
it should be
something useful.

15:12.937 --> 15:15.147
Now we'll do combat training.

15:15.937 --> 15:17.857
It might just be training,

15:17.937 --> 15:20.397
but if you're not alert,
it can be fatal. Understood?

15:20.897 --> 15:21.437
– Yes!
– Yes!

15:55.607 --> 15:58.437
Well... I guess that's it!

16:02.817 --> 16:03.857
Show me your left hand!

16:05.067 --> 16:07.897
Hey, it's nothing...

16:08.477 --> 16:09.937
It's just a scrape.

16:10.017 --> 16:11.897
A little spit will take care of it.

16:11.977 --> 16:12.977
Whatever! Just show me!

16:21.857 --> 16:23.017
I messed up...

16:23.857 --> 16:25.437
I got some sand in my eyes and...

16:33.937 --> 16:38.607
A scar or two on a man
is a badge of courage!

16:38.817 --> 16:42.017
I was just thinking how
I needed that.

16:42.727 --> 16:44.567
So this wound's...

16:44.687 --> 16:45.687
Ouch!

16:51.437 --> 16:53.767
Don't act tough and
hide your wounds.

16:54.857 --> 16:56.817
I'm always watching you.

16:58.567 --> 17:01.767
You promised me that you would
become Hokage, Obito.

17:02.817 --> 17:06.017
Listen, I want to stop this war too.

17:06.267 --> 17:09.067
I really want to save the world.

17:09.937 --> 17:14.857
So I decided to stick by your side
and watch over you.

17:18.357 --> 17:19.817
You told me saving you

17:19.897 --> 17:22.477
was the same as saving
the world, remember?

17:29.767 --> 17:30.567
Yeah...

17:31.147 --> 17:33.067
Since I'm keeping an eye on you,

17:34.067 --> 17:36.267
you can't hide anything
from me anymore.

17:36.857 --> 17:38.817
Okay! Okay!

17:40.067 --> 17:41.647
Go for it, Obito!

17:42.897 --> 17:46.397
Become Hokage and show me
how you'll save the world.

17:46.977 --> 17:48.727
That's another promise!

17:51.017 --> 17:51.937
Let's go!

18:22.067 --> 18:23.017
You...

18:23.937 --> 18:26.227
You told Kakashi Sensei
you would throw away

18:26.317 --> 18:28.937
all your memories and feelings
about your comrades.

18:30.067 --> 18:32.147
But when you became
the Ten Tails' Jinchuriki

18:32.227 --> 18:34.647
and were about to
be taken over by it...

18:45.107 --> 18:46.857
Didn't you try to suppress
the Ten Tails

18:46.937 --> 18:49.067
because you didn't want that?

19:16.977 --> 19:19.937
The reason why you beat
the Ten Tails and could control it

19:20.727 --> 19:23.897
was because you stood firm
on not throwing away the past

19:23.977 --> 19:25.817
and stayed yourself, right?

19:26.437 --> 19:29.187
You just couldn't throw out
the memories of

19:29.267 --> 19:34.607
my dad, Kakashi Sensei or
this Rin person, could you?

19:35.567 --> 19:38.017
That's how you could stay Obito

19:38.107 --> 19:40.317
even after you became
the Ten Tails' Jinchuriki.

19:42.647 --> 19:43.767
Am I wrong?

19:52.017 --> 19:56.477
But dragging everyone with you
onto your path

19:56.687 --> 19:58.067
and continuing on it
won't be allowed!

19:59.067 --> 20:02.397
I'm bringing you back
as Obito Uchiha...

20:02.817 --> 20:04.607
as a shinobi of the Hidden Leaf...

20:05.147 --> 20:07.067
and you're going to atone
for your sins.

20:10.477 --> 20:13.067
You tried to run away
from every single thing.

20:14.317 --> 20:16.937
<i>The only thing that awaits you...</i>

20:17.397 --> 20:21.017
<i>is your personal nightmare.</i>

20:24.437 --> 20:25.647
<i>Solitude!</i>

20:27.017 --> 20:29.147
<i>So why keep living in reality?</i>

20:30.567 --> 20:33.147
<i>Now come join us, Naruto!</i>

20:34.147 --> 20:37.977
I bet this Rin person would say this
if she were still alive...

20:39.107 --> 20:41.687
<i>Don't act tough and</i>
<i>hide your wounds.</i>

20:42.357 --> 20:44.147
<i>I'm always watching.</i>

20:47.147 --> 20:49.857
You're no one else but you,
damn it!

20:49.977 --> 20:51.227
Don't run away!

20:52.607 --> 20:55.437
Come join us...

20:56.357 --> 20:57.107
Obito!

